{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/ee0d17624de0e3c3a364fb8401bc8fab.avif?t=1753196011\" /></div><br>A hardcore top-down shooter with roguelike elements.<br>Get ready for fast-paced combat, procedural generation, permadeath, and meta-progression.<br>You play as a volunteer sent to the surface in search of vital resources. Explore rust-covered platforms, fight hostile machines, collect loot, and upgrade your skills. Maybe your run will be the one that changes everything \u2014 and gives humanity a second chance.<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/54169ebdd8a6d6a46f3b9d8739f42b22.poster.avif?t=1753196011\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/54169ebdd8a6d6a46f3b9d8739f42b22.webm?t=1753196011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/54169ebdd8a6d6a46f3b9d8739f42b22.mp4?t=1753196011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">High-Intensity Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies are deadly and unforgiving. You'll need precise aim and constant movement to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic Day-Night Cycle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some perks only work during the day, others \u2014 only at night. Plan your build wisely as time in the game moves forward relentlessly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Wide Arsenal of Weapons and Gadgets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix and match dozens of weapons and active items to handle any threat that comes your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Procedural Generation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levels, enemies, and loot are generated from scratch each time \u2014 no two runs are the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meta-Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death is not the end. Upgrade your starting base to improve your chances in future runs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Post-Apocalyptic Waterworld</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Civilization fell in a war against soulless machines. Cities are submerged, and the last survivors hide in underwater bunkers, venturing to the surface only in search of resources.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859430?t=1753196011","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859430?t=1753196011","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/9baa8337de7aedcc221e790e19e71453c86c793b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753196011","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/9baa8337de7aedcc221e790e19e71453c86c793b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753196011","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/ee0d17624de0e3c3a364fb8401bc8fab.avif?t=1753196011\" /></div><br>A hardcore top-down shooter with roguelike elements.<br>Get ready for fast-paced combat, procedural generation, permadeath, and meta-progression.<br>You play as a volunteer sent to the surface in search of vital resources. Explore rust-covered platforms, fight hostile machines, collect loot, and upgrade your skills. Maybe your run will be the one that changes everything \u2014 and gives humanity a second chance.<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"b